---@class gcp.health_v4.DeleteProjectsSubscribersSubscriptionsRequest
---@field name string Required. The resource name of the subscription to delete. Format: `projects/{project}/subscribers/{subscriber}/subscriptions/{subscription}` Example: `projects/my-project/subscribers/my-subscriber-123/subscriptions/my-subscription-456` The {subscriber} ID is user-settable (4-36 characters, matching /[a-z]([a-z0-9-]{2,34}[a-z0-9])/) if provided during creation, or system-generated otherwise. The {subscription} ID is user-settable (4-36 characters, matching /[a-z]([a-z0-9-]{2,34}[a-z0-9])/) or system-generated if not provided during creation.

