---@field parent string Required. Parent data type of the Data Point collection. Format: `users/{user}/dataTypes/{data_type}`, e.g.: - `users/me/dataTypes/steps` - `users/1234567890/dataTypes/steps` - `users/me/dataTypes/heart-rate` - `users/1234567890/dataTypes/heart-rate` The `{user}` can be either the alias `me` or the authenticated user's numeric Health User ID (retrieved via GetIdentity). For a list of the supported data types see the DataPoint data union field.
